# Two layers at once: the newest wins where they disagree, the other fills the rest.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/layers.padpack Base
press lb
press rb
tap south 30
tap east 30
tap north 30
release rb
tap south 30
release lb
---
shifts mode - layers Hotkeys        @0
shifts mode - layers Hotkeys, Extra @0
key KEY_F5 down                     @0
key KEY_F5 up                       @30
key KEY_F2 down                     @30
key KEY_F2 up                       @60
key KEY_F6 down                     @60
key KEY_F6 up                       @90
shifts mode - layers Hotkeys        @90
key KEY_F1 down                     @90
key KEY_F1 up                       @120
shifts mode - layers -              @120
